B.aUs=new A.cO("What is AI Hand Analysis?","In the Hand Replayer, tap the AI chip to get a full coaching breakdown of a recorded hand. The analysis covers pre-flop decisions, post-flop play, sizing tells, and specific spots where you may have deviated from optimal lines \u2014 with actionable suggestions.")
